{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter","id":1486260,"title":"TC Aether Kickstarter","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aether"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-11T23:28:28-07:00","id":1486260,"title":"TC Aether Kickstarter","content":"TC Aether Kickstarter will start in one week, at 7/19. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> KS link - <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/trinity-continuum-aether-tabletop-roleplaying-game\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...leplaying-game</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Aether-Splash.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <i>Call it what it was: hubris, arrogance, a collective delusion of grandeur\u2026 We thought we were the only beings in this universe and that with our grand intellect and glorious empires we were the best humanity would ever be.<br /> And then came Aether.<br /> And along with Aether came mental expansion, form mutation, matter warping, time manipulation, and the discovery of new worlds, new peoples, new and terrifying possibilities.<br /> And with Aether came the doom of humankind. Aether brought the Martians to our world, and the unravelling of the reality we knew</i>.<br /> <br /> Aether is a full rule and setting expansion for the Trinity Continuum line of games, set in the year 1895, at a time when humanity has conquered its own world, and now seeks to conquer the limitations imposed on us by the laws of all the sciences known to our kind. Inside, you will find:<ul><li>A complete Victorian-era setting and Paths for characters to embark upon within it.</li> <li>Aether powers allowing you to manipulate fate, space, time, and even your own bodies in wondrous and horrifying ways.</li> <li>Societies both lawful and rogue, looking to leave their imprint on the world, from those in league with Mina Harker to those affiliated with Dr. Jekyll and Moriarty.</li> <li>Storyguide advice, secrets, hooks, and plots, to enable you to start your game of <b>Aether</b> off with a bang.</li> </ul>Proposed <b>Aether</b> cover<br /> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/ShenFei_TC-Aether-Cover-Artwork.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-12-2022, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-12T07:36:48-07:00","id":1486276,"title":"","content":"I've been asking for the Trinity Continuum cover art to be put up on Redbubble for years now. I want posters!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Joi