A society focused on opening Aether Gates to alternate versions of Earth to allow the successful assassination and replacement of selected targets.'<br /> <br /> And now we know how <b>TC Assassins</b> come to be in 'main' <b>Trinity</b> timeline... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> '<b>Students of Tesla:</b> A society, the members of which study, research, and master Aether use, <br /> spinning up experiments in nominally safe environments and only involving knowledgeable volunteers.'<br /> <br /> I can now be <b>Student of <i>Tesla</i></b> - f#$% yeah! \ud83e\udd18\u26a1\ud83e\udd18","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-20-2022, 12:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T01:30:49-07:00","id":1487128,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the difference between a Gog and a Magog also gives a nod to The Picture of Dorian Grey? Dorian was in many ways a version of the Giant who stored his heart elsewhere. <br /> <br /> As Gog and Magog were giants (tribes descended from whom were to destroy the world) I wonder if Joseph Campbell gives us a clue here. He suggested that the Titans were depicted as giants because they didn't fit into the pattern of the world. This wasn't an evil thing. The pattern of the world having been created by the Bronze Age kings and their High Priests in order to dominate the world leaving a pattern no one needed or wanted anymore was an act of self-liberation. But a self-liberated person could be seen in different lights depending on who views them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T02:05:54-07:00","id":1487135,"title":"","content":"Very happy to see we've already hit a stretch goal within the first day! Excellent stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T04:59:41-07:00","id":1487172,"title":"","content":"Holy Stoker, the SOM and the Immortals are bloody awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error;