mages/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>They are already\u2026 Aether ir part of the Continuum and it did happen before Adventure!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T07:33:22-07:00","id":1487190,"title":"","content":"And the second stretch goal is down!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3241-stannis","name":"Stannis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3241_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T08:20:04-07:00","id":1487197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They are already\u2026 Aether ir part of the Continuum and it did happen before Adventure! </div> </div> </div>Ah, thats right, of course - Sorry, I have expressed myself in a misleading way. I didn't mean the Continuum as a whole, but Trinity:Continuum, that is, the timeline from the basic rulebook that takes place in the present. <br /> Since, to my knowledge, no vampires are mentioned in any later epoch of Trinity (at least not beyond vague hints in the first edition of Adventure), it might be reasonable to think that the Immortals no longer exist after Aether. (At least not in the form shown there as gothic horror monsters). But I would find that a bit of a pity <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T08:24:29-07:00","id":1487198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487197#post1487197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, thats right, of course - Sorry, I have expressed myself in a misleading way. I didn't mean the Continuum as a whole, but Trinity:Continuum, that is, the timeline from the basic rulebook that takes place in the present.<br /> Since, to my knowledge, no vampires are mentioned in any later epoch of Trinity (at least not beyond vague hints in the first edition of Adventure), it might be reasonable to think that the Immortals no longer exist after Aether. (At least not in the form shown there as gothic horror monsters). But I would find that a bit of a pity <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There's every possibility that they do, but that this is the book that introduces them...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T11:16:12-07:00","id":1487214,"title":"","content":"I kind of want to try making some sort of &quot;society of the night&quot; of modern descendants of the Immortals, but who draw mainly on things like Anne Rice, Vampire the Masquerade, the Blade films, and Call of Night for inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T13:07:21-07:00","id":1487239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487214#post1487214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of want to try making some sort of &amp;quot;society of the night&amp;quot; of modern descendants of the Immortals, but who draw mainly on things like Anne Rice, Vampire the Masquerade, the Blade films, and Call of Night for inspiration.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s a great idea! Also, I love that they brought back the Order of Murder from Adventure! 1e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T14:08:36-07:00","id":1487249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487197#post1487197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, thats right, of course - Sorry, I have expressed myself in a misleading way. I didn't mean the Continuum as a whole, but Trinity:Continuum, that is, the timeline from the basic rulebook that takes place in the present.<br /> Since, to my knowledge, no vampires are mentioned in any later epoch of Trinity (at least not beyond vague hints in the first edition of Adventure), it might be reasonable to think that the Immortals no longer exist after Aether. (At least not in the form shown there as gothic horror monsters). But I would find that a bit of a pity <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The core book does specify (on page 164):<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Maxwell</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Mercer</span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> seemed </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">to</span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> have</span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> an </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">eye </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">towards </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">the</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">strange, and sure enough wherever he direct</span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">ed the Society they discovered undead, aliens, </span></span><span style=\"font-family:serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">and any number of other preternatural beings.</span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T17:50:00-07:00","id":1487287,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping we get some sort of explorer society drawing from stuff like Alan Quartermain, Professor Challenger, Journey to the Center of the Earth, and various Space 1889 tropes. I'm not sure what a potential counter society of such a group might be. \ud83e\udd14","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T22:14:47-07:00","id":1487313,"title":"","content":"So the Strange Places are inspired by Castlevania anime series. Dracula is powerful alchemist that works from moving, invisible castle. And there is Corridor to Infinity, that leads everywhere in reality. \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-20T23:26:43-07:00","id":1487315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487287#post1487287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm hoping we get some sort of explorer society drawing from stuff like Alan Quartermain, Professor Challenger, Journey to the Center of the Earth, and various Space 1889 tropes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think, Os Viajantes is exactely that. When it comes to possible enemies of this society, there would, in my view, countless possibilities. So, maybe the Os Viajantes do not have a specific arch-enemy but instead have to deal with whatever dangers they find, when they explore new worlds. This would be very much in line with some of the classic novels, that inspired this society. Journey to the Center of the Earth for example did not have anything, that only resembled a villain. Instead, the Lidenbrock-Expedition had to battle nature itself, so to say, because the area, they had to traverse was dangerous.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24955-waldi","name":"Waldi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T04:45:11-07:00","id":1487359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Waldi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487315#post1487315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think, Os Viajantes is exactely that. When it comes to possible enemies of this society, there would, in my view, countless possibilities. So, maybe the Os Viajantes do not have a specific arch-enemy but instead have to deal with whatever dangers they find, when they explore new worlds. This would be very much in line with some of the classic novels, that inspired this society. Journey to the Center of the Earth for example did not have anything, that only resembled a villain. Instead, the Lidenbrock-Expedition had to battle nature itself, so to say, because the area, they had to traverse was dangerous.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are exactly right. I could certainly see Os Viajantes members working alongside Students of Tesla and Esoteric Orderers, maybe with an SOM Aethernaut in the mix to fight off any unusual cryptids they encounter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T05:14:43-07:00","id":1487367,"title":"","content":"Do Os Viajantes have something like more British version or chapter in United Kingdoms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"att