:00","id":1487479,"title":"","content":"So Esoteric Order of Aeons is MtAw Mysterium in S-F setting. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T09:39:02-07:00","id":1487487,"title":"","content":"I'm going to use everything in Aether about India has to offer for my 1920s story in region in Adventure! \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T11:49:51-07:00","id":1487498,"title":"","content":"I am having issues with Google forms today, so I will add a comment here, if anyone can send it to the errata.<br /> <br /> In page 25 it says &quot;fledgling Brazilian Rep\u00fablica Velha&quot;. Rep\u00fablica Velha means Old Republic, it was called that way much later, after the 1930 revolution created the New Republic (Rep\u00fablica Nova). Even after the 1930s it was called First Republic (Primeira Rep\u00fablica). At the time it was not called Rep\u00fablica Velha, it was just called Rep\u00fablica.<br /> In fact, in 1895 Brazilian Republic was brand new, as it was created in 1889 (November 15), and Marshal Deodoro da Fonseca was the First President of Brazil (1889 to 1891, and he died in 1892).<br /> From 1822 to 1889 Brazil was an empire and before that it was a colony of Portugal.<br /> <br /> All that to explain that we should just call it Brazilian government, instead o Brazilian Rep\u00fablica Velha.<br /> <br /> Edit: Another interesting fact, Deodoro da Fonseca had African ascestry, mixed, much like Machado de Assis (the most well known writter from the time), and they were pictured as white men in the news and books, while they had brown skin and other traits that made clear their ancestry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 07-22-2022, 02:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T12:59:09-07:00","id":1487503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487498#post1487498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am having issues with Google forms today, so I will add a comment here, if anyone can send it to the errata.<br /> <br /> In page 25 it says &amp;quot;fledgling Brazilian Rep\u00fablica Velha&amp;quot;. Rep\u00fablica Velha means Old Republic, it was called that way much later, after the 1930 revolution created the New Republic (Rep\u00fablica Nova). Even after the 1930s it was called First Republic (Primeira Rep\u00fablica). At the time it was not called Rep\u00fablica Velha, it was just called Rep\u00fablica.<br /> In fact, in 1895 Brazilian Republic was brand new, as it was created in 1889 (November 15), and Marshal Deodoro da Fonseca was the First President of Brazil (1889 to 1891, and he died in 1892).<br /> From 1822 to 1889 Brazil was an empire and before that it was a colony of Portugal.<br /> <br /> All that to explain that we should just call it Brazilian government, instead o Brazilian Rep\u00fablica Velha.<br /> <br /> Edit: Another interesting fact, Deodoro da Fonseca had African ascestry, mixed, much like Machado de Assis (the most well known writter from the time), and they were pictured as white men in the news and books, while they had brown skin and other traits that made clear their ancestry.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a feedback form so you can send that to us. Ask James on the Kickstarter!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-22T14:56:48-07:00","id":1487509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1486260-tc-aether-kickstarter?p=1487503#post1487503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's a feedback form so you can send that to us. Ask James on the Kickstarter!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah; that's why he mentioned that he's having trouble with Google Forms today","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\"